  "stageId": "a003_st04",
  "title": "愛某個人",
  "storyCode": "OF-ST4",
  "avgTag": "幕間",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsData/tw/gamedata/story/activities/act3d0/level_act3d0_st04.txt",
  "sourceHash": "42f54a01923a6446f1da2f8105a41ebe271ab2925709925f00de2823fac8d27a",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "第三关（前）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑",
      "speakerToken": "char_340_shwaz_2#2",
      "operatorId": "char_340_shwaz",
      "portraitKey": "char_340_shwaz",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛寧",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_023_2#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "所以你們都知道了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "錫蘭",
      "speakerToken": "char_348_ceylon_4#3",
      "operatorId": "char_348_ceylon",
      "portraitKey": "char_348_ceylon",
      "text": "這樣簡單的騙局，又能欺瞞多久呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "紅豆",
      "speakerToken": "char_290_vigna",
      "operatorId": "char_290_vigna",
      "portraitKey": "char_290_vigna",
      "text": "啊，LIVE快開始了......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "D.D.D.",
      "speakerToken": "avg_NPC_017_3#3",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "女士們，先生們，歡迎你們來到黑曜石節！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "D.D.D.",
      "speakerToken": "avg_NPC_017_3#1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你們過得愉快嗎！！！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "觀眾",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "（狂熱的歡呼聲）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "D.D.D.",
      "speakerToken": "avg_NPC_017_3#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "多麼熱情的回應，但是我要告訴你們，你們還沒有見識到黑曜石節真正的魅力！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "D.D.D.",
      "speakerToken": "avg_NPC_017_3#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "今晚，所有邀請的音樂家們將齊聚一堂，為你們帶來無上的聽覺與視覺的盛宴！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "D.D.D.",
      "speakerToken": "avg_NPC_017_3#1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "一個主場舞台，四個大舞台，十二個小舞台，四十位來自各領域的知名音樂家，十八個小時，將會一直演出直到明天的太陽升起！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "D.D.D.",
      "speakerToken": "avg_NPC_017_3#5",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "告訴我，你們準備好了嗎！！！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "觀眾",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "（瘋狂的歡呼聲）"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑",
      "speakerToken": "char_340_shwaz_2#2",
      "operatorId": "char_340_shwaz",
      "portraitKey": "char_340_shwaz",
      "text": "......錫蘭告訴了我火山的事情了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑",
      "speakerToken": "char_340_shwaz_2#2",
      "operatorId": "char_340_shwaz",
      "portraitKey": "char_340_shwaz",
      "text": "所以你不僅篡改了火山監測資料，而且宣稱小姐要散佈謠言。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛寧",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_023_2#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "因為你我都知道啊。赫爾曼做的那些事，我們都知道！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "知道什麼的話，就說吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_024",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "克洛寧，說下去吧。但你也要把我“因事務出差”的時候，你到底做了些什麼，全都說出來。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "錫蘭",
      "speakerToken": "char_348_ceylon_4#8",
      "operatorId": "char_348_ceylon",
      "portraitKey": "char_348_ceylon",
      "text": "爸——父親？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛寧",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_023_2#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你怎麼在這裡？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫爾曼",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_024",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "很意外嗎，克洛寧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫爾曼",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_024",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "在我明令禁止了從火山中開採黑曜石之後，在市場上依然有新開採的黑曜石流通。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫爾曼",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_024",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "開採隊很多次出現在火山口，卻沒有人向我報告。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫爾曼",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_024",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "最終開採的貨物經過多次轉送，已經被送到了市政廳的廢棄倉庫。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫爾曼",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_024",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "在我下令撥款為汐斯塔出現的礦石病患者提供各方面資助後，市裡反而出現了各種他們受到的不公待遇的流言。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫爾曼",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_024",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "這些事情有沒有讓你意外過？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛寧",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_023_2#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "嘁......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫爾曼",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_024",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "這些事情讓我意外到憤怒難安！！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫爾曼",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_024",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "為了找到這些事情的真相，我放出了離開城市的消息，讓黑作為我的下屬替我在城市調查真相。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫拉格",
      "speakerToken": "char_188_helage_1",
      "operatorId": "char_188_helage",
      "portraitKey": "char_188_helage",
      "text": "看來，只要調查一下這些記錄和相關人員就行了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "錫蘭",
      "speakerToken": "char_348_ceylon_4#8",
      "operatorId": "char_348_ceylon",
      "portraitKey": "char_348_ceylon",
      "text": "赫拉格爺爺，你們也平安無事！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫爾曼",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_024",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "真遺憾，克洛寧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫爾曼",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_024",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "原本，我是不介意和你分享一些東西的，但你太急躁了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛寧",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_023_2#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我？急躁？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛寧",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_023_2#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我這些不都是為了這個城市，不都是你教我的嗎！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛寧",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_023_2#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "十年前的巴魯一家，八年前的電視塔倒塌案，還有你如何說服......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛寧",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_023_2#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "哦，我想是不是用吞併更好一些？你是如何吞併塔拉克部族的，我都看在眼裡。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛寧",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_023_2#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我的一切都是從您那裡學來的......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛寧",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_023_2#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "盈利，處理。手段不重要，結果才是重要的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛寧",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_023_2#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "這個破爛的鄉下，你以為我為它付出了多少心血，換來的又有什麼？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛寧",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_023_2#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "好不容易因為黑曜石帶來的收益，卻要全部變成給那些根本治不好的病人的補貼？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛寧",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_023_2#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "與其如此，還不如就讓火山爆發好了！而我只需要保護好汐斯塔的物資和財產，一樣可以東山再起！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫爾曼",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_024",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我做過許多事。但我不會拿汐斯塔做賭注。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫爾曼",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_024",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "礦工和研究者的生命，全城的生命都被你視作什麼了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫爾曼",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_024",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "克洛寧，你被解雇了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛寧",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_023_2#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "哈哈哈哈糊塗的老頭，那可還說不清楚！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛寧",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_023_2#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "多虧你的喋喋不休，我的人手已經全都到了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊芙利特",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "嗯？等等，我怎麼烤焦了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊芙利特",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "角峰叔！你來看一下！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊芙利特",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "搞什麼，感覺溫度流向都變了......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "古米",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "嗯嗯嗯！海浪好大！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "古米",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "欸！海浪變得好大哦！也太大了吧哈哈哈哈哈！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "普羅旺斯",
      "speakerToken": "char_145_prove_1",
      "operatorId": "char_145_prove",
      "portraitKey": "char_145_prove",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "天火",
      "speakerToken": "char_166_skfire_3#1",
      "operatorId": "char_166_skfire",
      "portraitKey": "char_166_skfire",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "普羅旺斯",
      "speakerToken": "char_145_prove_1",
      "operatorId": "char_145_prove",
      "portraitKey": "char_145_prove",
      "text": "怎麼不說話了，你剛剛明明話很多的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "天火",
      "speakerToken": "char_166_skfire_3#1",
      "operatorId": "char_166_skfire",
      "portraitKey": "char_166_skfire",
      "text": "我在想。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "普羅旺斯",
      "speakerToken": "char_145_prove_1",
      "operatorId": "char_145_prove",
      "portraitKey": "char_145_prove",
      "text": "唔，像你這樣的人居然還有這麼沉默寡言的時候。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "天火",
      "speakerToken": "char_166_skfire_3#1",
      "operatorId": "char_166_skfire",
      "portraitKey": "char_166_skfire",
      "text": "我感覺我的大腦有些激動，先讓我冷靜一下。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "普羅旺斯",
      "speakerToken": "char_145_prove_1",
      "operatorId": "char_145_prove",
      "portraitKey": "char_145_prove",
      "text": "不是，雖然我不是地質學家，也不懂什麼源石物理啊高能源石技藝啊......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "天火",
      "speakerToken": "char_166_skfire_3#1",
      "operatorId": "char_166_skfire",
      "portraitKey": "char_166_skfire",
      "text": "高能源石技藝和火山生態學是兩回事，肯定沒辦法解決我們現在的問題。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "天火",
      "speakerToken": "char_166_skfire_3#1",
      "operatorId": "char_166_skfire",
      "portraitKey": "char_166_skfire",
      "text": "硬要說的話，造一個巨大的容器把所有能量抽出來，也許......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "天火",
      "speakerToken": "char_166_skfire_3#1",
      "operatorId": "char_166_skfire",
      "portraitKey": "char_166_skfire",
      "text": "可這種法術，就連我也要編個好幾年。不可能的，完全不可能。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "普羅旺斯",
      "speakerToken": "char_145_prove_1",
      "operatorId": "char_145_prove",
      "portraitKey": "char_145_prove",
      "text": "我說了我不懂啊！但現在的情況，很不妙吧！非常有問題啊！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "天火",
      "speakerToken": "char_166_skfire_3#1",
      "operatorId": "char_166_skfire",
      "portraitKey": "char_166_skfire",
      "text": "是不妙啊！你以為什麼情況下我才會激動啊！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "普羅旺斯",
      "speakerToken": "char_145_prove_1",
      "operatorId": "char_145_prove",
      "portraitKey": "char_145_prove",
      "text": "想想辦法啊！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "天火",
      "speakerToken": "char_166_skfire_3#1",
      "operatorId": "char_166_skfire",
      "portraitKey": "char_166_skfire",
      "text": "我不是在想嗎！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "普羅旺斯",
      "speakerToken": "char_145_prove_1",
      "operatorId": "char_145_prove",
      "portraitKey": "char_145_prove",
      "text": "必須趕緊把這件事告訴博士才行......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "普羅旺斯",
      "speakerToken": "char_145_prove_1",
      "operatorId": "char_145_prove",
      "portraitKey": "char_145_prove",
      "text": "那就拜託你好好想想了，我立刻去發報！可別被熱昏頭腦！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "天火",
      "speakerToken": "char_166_skfire_3#1",
      "operatorId": "char_166_skfire",
      "portraitKey": "char_166_skfire",
      "text": "我很冷靜。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "普羅旺斯",
      "speakerToken": "char_145_prove_1",
      "operatorId": "char_145_prove",
      "portraitKey": "char_145_prove",
      "text": "剛才你才說很激動來著！而且你頭髮都燒著了啊！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "天火",
      "speakerToken": "char_166_skfire_3#1",
      "operatorId": "char_166_skfire",
      "portraitKey": "char_166_skfire",
      "text": "唔，生態圈惡化導致的地質演變......哼，還有救！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ],
  "observedOperators": [
